# What the web image build may see. The build context is the whole
# repository, so start by excluding EVERYTHING (.env with passwords included)
# and let back in only what web/Dockerfile copies.
*
!web/
!infra/caddy/Caddyfile
!infra/caddy/Caddyfile.tailnet

# Inside web/: never the local installs or build outputs.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/playwright-report/
web/test-results/
